    Bug 2004841 - Fix memory leak in compose attachment tracker. r=john.bieling

    We need to listen for attachments being removed even when there is nothing listening for the API
    event, so that we don't continue to track attachments which are no longer attached. Just forgetting
    attachments that are still attached when the window closes is insufficient.

    Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D276418

